                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I voted yes on the Lower Health Care Premiums for All Americans Act. \n\nH.R. 6703 takes a practical approach to expanding affordable health care options, lowering premiums, and saving taxpayers $36 billion by addressing the root causes of skyrocketing prices.\n\nSpecifically, it: \n\n\u2705Reduces ACA Marketplace premiums by 11 percent through support of Cost Sharing Reductions (CSRs)\n\n\u2705Expands Association Health Plans (AHPs) to let self-employed individuals and small businesses pair up to lower premiums by as much as 30 percent\n\n\u2705Encourages employers to offer healthcare benefits by strengthening CHOICE Arrangements\n\n\u2705Lowers the cost of prescription drugs by requiring Pharmacy Benefit Manager (PBM) transparency",
